p for bottled water  now most of the lead pipes leading into  people's homes have been checked for  safety  but many residents say they still have  damaged pipes inside their homes  as for these charges they haven't been  officially filed yet but cbs news has  learned  they're coming soon tony adriana thank  you i'm so glad we're sticking with that  story all these years later because the  repercussions are still around  thank you very much
 

